    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nAutomate, simplify, and sign faster with Smart Link Forms\nSmart Link Forms eliminate manual bottlenecks, ideal for high-volume workflows and commonly used documents. Embed Smart Link Forms on your website or send them directly, making it incredibly easy for signers to take action with online forms.\nCreate a smooth signing experience for your users\nSimplify your workflows and provide world-class signer experiences with Smart Link Forms. It's eSignature on their terms.\nAutomate Your Document Processes and Minimize Unnecessary Delays\n\nTransform your document workflows by automating eSignature processes. Smart Link Forms eliminate manual bottlenecks, allowing you to reduce unnecessary delays and focus on what matters most. By automating repetitive tasks, you ensure that documents are processed swiftly and accurately, enhancing overall productivity.\n\nEmbed Smart Link Forms on Your Website or Send Them Directly\n\nEnhance accessibility and convenience for your signers by embedding Smart Link Forms directly on your website or sharing them via a direct link. This flexibility ensures that your clients or partners can initiate the signing process effortlessly, whether they're visiting your site or receiving a form through email. The seamless integration with your existing digital presence makes it easier than ever to collect signatures.\n\nSigners Can Complete and Sign Documents on Their Own Schedule\n\nWith Smart Link Forms, individuals can complete and sign documents at their own pace, on their own schedule. This user-friendly approach ensures that signers are not constrained by time or location, leading to a more efficient and satisfactory signing experience.\n\nIdeal for High-Volume Workflows and Commonly Used Forms\n\nWhether you're managing routine agreements, consent forms, or large-scale contract signing operations, Smart Link Forms streamline the process, making document management more efficient.\n\nTestimonials\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nEducation\nBette Jo T.\nAdministrative Assistant\nCustomer service is superior to Docusign\nUtilizing BlueInk has improved our department greatly! We are able to get necessary paperwork signed quickly and I love how BlueInk sends reminders when the forms are not signed. We can [also] send consent forms via BlueInk and get it signed that very same day. When using USPS, we might wait for months for the paperwork.\nEducation\nElizabeth B.\nDirector of Special Education\nExcellent product to obtain quick and easy signature\nI absolutely love this product and use it daily.\nEducation\nJason V.\nDirector of Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Programs\nBLUEINK is the best solution that I have found for Digital Signatures in an Educational environment\nExceptional! I have told all of my colleagues about this program and am excited to present on it in the future; as it is a truly perfect fit for Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Coordinators in Georgia!\nEducation\nJulie H.\nRecruiting\nVery impactful – bundling documents saves us money\nThe business problem we have solved is sending documents in a bundle. With our last company, we had to send individual documents, which was much more costly. Our experience [with Blueink] has been great.\nEducation\nJulie L\nHR Manager\nGrateful for this Product\nI especially like that I can obtain an electronic signature due to folks being at different locations. I also appreciate the tracking abilities. It is simply a quality product!!\nPick your plan\nBilled monthly\nBilled yearly\n\n*Save up to 40%\nStandard\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nStandard plan - 40% less\n\n$15\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$180 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nStandard Plan includes:\n120 Envelopes / User / Year\n5 Templates / User\nBlueink Payments\nAuto Detect Fields\nReal-time audit trail\nSMS Pin / Selfie / ID Authentication\nCC Additional Recipients\nEmail / Chat Support\nBusiness Pro\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nBusiness Pro plan - 25% less\n\n$30\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$360 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Standard features, plus:\n1800 Envelopes / User / Year\n12 Templates / User\nSMS Delivery\nReminder Emails\nCustom Messaging\nAttachment Fields\nMOST POPULAR\nBlueink Unlimited\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nProfessional Unlimited - 86% less\n\n$40\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$480 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Business Pro features, plus:\nUnlimited Envelopes / User / Year\nUnlimited Templates\nTeams\nSigning Brands\nEnterprise\n\nAdvanced Solutions\n\n\n\nLet’s talk\nUNLIMITED USERS\nContact Sales\nOther benefits include:\n\nUnlimited Users\nUnlimited Templates\nBulk Send\nSmart Link Forms\nCustom Reporting\nCustomer Success Team\nAPI and Embedded Signing Access\n\nLooking for quote? Request a personalized quote from Blueink.\n\nAdvanced functionality at the best price\nFeature  name\nBlueink\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nPrice\n$15 / Per User\n$25 / Per User\n$14.99 / Per User\n$19 / Per User\nUsers\nUnlimited\nCost Per\nCost Per\nCost Per\nNo Overages Fees\nUnused Envelopes\nRollover\nExpire\nExpire\nExpire\nSupport, Training & Onboarding\nIncluded\nAdditional Cost\nAdditional Cost\nAdditional Cost\nUnlimited Envelope Plan\nCustomer Service\n4.8/5\n4.3/5\n4.5/5\n4.3/5\nFAQs\n​What is a Smart Link?\n\nA Smart Link is a clickable URL link that allows people to access and sign your business documents at any time. It eliminates the need for emailing documents back